      "creatureType": "construct",
      "blurb": "Bakuton: Clay Bird",
      "biography": "<p><em>Explosion Release: Clay Bird (Bakuton Hijutsu).</em> It uses your Ninjutsu attack bonus or Save DC when an effect calls for it. You command it as an Action or Bonus action.</p><p><strong>Armor Class</strong> 12 + your ninjutsu ability modifier · <strong>Hit Points</strong> 40 + 10 for every rank above C-Rank · <strong>Speed</strong> 45 ft. flying</p><p><strong>Abilities</strong> STR +2 (save +4), DEX +4 (+8), CON +3 (+7), INT −5, WIS +0, CHA −5. <strong>Damage Vulnerability</strong> Lightning. <strong>Damage Immunities</strong> Acid, Poison, Psychic. <strong>Condition Immunities</strong> All Mental, All Sensory, Stunned, Exhaustion. <strong>Senses</strong> Relies on Caster senses.</p><p><strong>Linked to you when summoned:</strong> its AC (base + your Ninjutsu ability modifier), hit points (by the rank you cast the jutsu at), Ninjutsu attack bonus and save DC, and your senses.</p>",
      "summonRole": "Clay Bird"
