        "description": "<p>The Clay Bird detonates in a beautiful incendiary display, filling a 10-foot radius centered on it. All creatures in the radius takes force damage on a failed Dexterity saving throw or half as much on a success based on the rank the Clay Bird was summoned at. If more than one Clay Bird is Detonating and the same creature is within more than 1 radius, they make a single saving throw, but increase the damage they take by +2d8 for each additional Clay Bird explosion radius they are in. D-Rank/C-Rank: 4d8. B-Rank/A-Rank: 5d8. S-Rank: 6d8.</p>",
